SUMMARY:All About Angiosperms: Walk and Talk
DESCRIPTION:Spring flowers abound in the Arboretum! Depending on bloom time\, we’ll explore the rose or magnolia collections to learn the reason for flowers and dive into how flowering plants evolved across the globe.\nBring a camera or a sketch book on this slow-paced stroll to stop and enjoy the flowers. This event is coordinated by Hoyt Arboretum and registration is required through their website.
URL:https://explorewashingtonpark.org/event/all-about-angiosperms-walk-and-talk/
LOCATION:Hoyt Arboretum\, 4000 SW Fairview Blvd\, Portland\, OR\, 97221\, United States
END:VEVENT
