LAST-MODIFIED:20260415T213248Z
UID:10003244-1779532200-1779539400@explorewashingtonpark.org
SUMMARY:Ivy Basket Making Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Using invasive English ivy\, we’ll transform this ubiquitous plant into something unique.  Using a basic basket making technique\, we’ll create artistic and useful objects.  You will leave the workshop with your ivy creation\, and the know-how to make interesting things from one of the Pacific Northwest’s most problematic introduced plants. This event is coordinated by Hoyt Arboretum and registration is required through their website.
URL:https://explorewashingtonpark.org/event/ivy-basket-making-workshop/
LOCATION:Hoyt Arboretum\, 4000 SW Fairview Blvd\, Portland\, OR\, 97221\, United States
END:VEVENT
